--- A fact holds no error: a ui program's fact declared from a value that
--- can fail — a file that is not there — stops the program where the facts
--- are set, with the reason, before anything is served, in both modes.
--- (The interpreter had held the error in the fact; the compiled program
--- had not built, a session's state unable to keep it.)
use web, ui, frame

trades = load['/no/such/trades.csv']
clicks = 0

view render[]
    return p['`len[trades]` rows, `clicks` clicks']

page['/', render]
serve[3000]
